  "context": {
    "explanation_en": "Hedging softens a statement to sound less direct or more polite, common in casual speech: 'I guess', 'sort of', 'kind of', 'a bit'. 'It's sort of complicated.' 'I guess I could help.' These make opinions feel less absolute.",
    "explanation_ko": "완곡 표현은 발언을 덜 직접적이고 더 정중하게 만들며, 캐주얼한 대화에서 자주 씁니다: 'I guess', 'sort of', 'kind of', 'a bit'. 'It's sort of complicated.' 'I guess I could help.' 의견을 덜 단정적으로 들리게 합니다.",
    "key_expressions": [
      {
        "en": "I guess it could work.",
        "ko": "될 것 같기는 해요."
      },
      {
        "en": "It's kind of hard to explain.",
        "ko": "설명하기가 좀 어려워요."
      },
      {
        "en": "I'm sort of busy right now.",
        "ko": "지금 좀 바빠요."
      }
    ]
  },
